# Inactive identity compatibility views

This module prepares current-contract views while preserving nine existing compatibility APIs.
Previous views retain contract 1.0.10; legacy views retain 1.0.8. Identity previous views restore 1.0.11.

Explicit byte readers, whole-source pins, historical origins and current inputs retain separate authority.
Returned models are private copies; per-call byte caches close before later bulk work.

The tests use staged complete-model fixtures. They do not install or adopt contract 1.0.12.
Source, execution and independent review records describe the verified scope and retained findings.
Native, UI, database, backend restart, capacity and full SysON acceptance remain open.
